{"n":36,"v":[["Yâ Sîn","",[[["يسٓ","P","INL|",-1]]]],["Par le Coran plein de sagesse","",[[["وَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["قُرْءَانِ","N","PN|M|GEN",163]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حَكِيمِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",106]]]],["Tu (Muhammad) es certes du nombre des messagers","",[[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4],["كَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MS",-1]],[["لَ","P","EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["مِنَ","P","P",0]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مُرْسَلِينَ","N","PASS_PCPL|VF:4|MP|GEN",321]]]],["sur un chemin droit","",[[["عَلَىٰ","P","P",8]],[["صِرَٰطٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",241]],[["مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:10|M|INDEF|GEN",298]]]],["C'est une révélation de la part du Tout Puissant, du Très Miséricordieux","",[[["تَنزِيلَ","N","VN|VF:2|M|ACC",622]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["عَزِيزِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",104]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["رَّحِيمِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",94]]]],["pour que tu avertisses un peuple dont les ancêtres n'ont pas été avertis: ils sont donc insouciants","",[[["لِ","P","PRP|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["تُنذِرَ","V","IMPF|VF:4|2MS|MOOD:SUBJ",247]],[["قَوْمًا","N","M|INDEF|ACC",24]],[["مَّآ","P","NEG",12]],[["أُنذِرَ","V","PERF|VF:4|PASS|3MS",247]],[["ءَابَآؤُ","N","MP|NOM",174],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["هُمْ","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["غَٰفِلُونَ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|MP|NOM",385]]]],["En effet, la Parole contre la plupart d'entre eux s'est réalisée: ils ne croiront donc pas","",[[["لَ","P","EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["قَدْ","P","CERT",22]],[["حَقَّ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",499]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["قَوْلُ","N","VN|VF:1|M|NOM",110]],[["عَلَىٰٓ","P","P",8]],[["أَكْثَرِ","N","MS|GEN",130],["هِمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["هُمْ","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["لَا","P","NEG",2]],[["يُؤْمِنُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|3MP|MOOD:IND",18],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]]]],["Nous mettrons des carcans à leurs cous, et il y en aura jusqu'aux mentons: et voilà qu'ils iront têtes dressée