 Coran), et craint le Tout Miséricordieux, malgré qu'il ne Le voit pas. Annonce-lui un pardon et une récompense généreuse","",[[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4],["مَا","P","PREV",12]],[["تُنذِرُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|2MS|MOOD:IND",247]],[["مَنِ","N","REL",13]],[["ٱتَّبَعَ","V","PERF|VF:8|3MS",81]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["ذِّكْرَ","N","VN|VF:1|M|ACC",140]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["خَشِىَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",277]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["رَّحْمَٰنَ","N","MS|ACC",193]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["غَيْبِ","N","M|GEN",226]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["بَشِّرْ","V","IMPV|VF:2|2MS",292],["هُ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["مَغْفِرَةٍ","N","F|INDEF|GEN",372]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["أَجْرٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",103]],[["كَرِيمٍ","N","MS|INDEF|GEN|ADJ",359]]]],["C'est Nous qui ressuscitons les morts et écrivons ce qu'ils ont fait [pour l'au-delà] ainsi que leurs traces. Et Nous avons dénombré toute chose dans un registre explicite","",[[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4],["ا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["نَحْنُ","N","PRON|1P",-1]],[["نُحْىِ","V","IMPF|VF:4|1P|MOOD:IND",216]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مَوْتَىٰ","N","P|NOM",293]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["نَكْتُبُ","V","IMPF|VF:1|1P|MOOD:IND",229]],[["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["قَدَّمُ","V","PERF|VF:2|3MP",386],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ءَاثَٰرَ","N","MP|ACC",647],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["كُلَّ","N","M|ACC",28]],[["شَىْءٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",38]],[["أَحْصَيْ","V","PERF|VF:4|1P",850],["نَٰ","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1],["هُ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["فِىٓ","P","P",3]],[["إِمَامٍ","N","MS|INDEF|GEN",696]],[["مُّبِينٍ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:4|M|INDEF|GEN",93]]]],["Donne-leur comme exemple les habitants de la cité, quand lui vinrent les envoyés","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱضْرِبْ","V","IMPV|VF:1|2MS",203]],[["لَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["